"Full WLTC on the step 2 starter (derived; VehicleSystemsComponents.Lecture5.P2OperatingLineWLTCTransient)."
analysis Step2OperatingLineWLTCTransient
  extends TransientAnalysis(stop = 1800.0, alg = ODEAlg.Rodas5P(), dtmax = 1.0, optimize = OptimizationLevel.None())
  model = Step2OperatingLineWLTC()
relations
end